  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/71) by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello, perhaps the order of the locations panel can be changed/inversed? \n\nSince many years RawTherapee shows two times my home directory \\(paul\\), and ART inherites that. Furthermore the locations panel shows a generic usb reader that I haven’t used for the last ten years, it fills up valuable ‘screen estate’ though. My favorite directories show only up when I scroll the panel down. Easiest solution is to reverse that order, so MyLocations first, followed by the rest. \n\nAnd it would be fine if I could change the names of my favorite locations. Right now I have two times ‘marseille’, one series made in 2017 and the other in 2018. \n\nThanks for reading \\(and for your excellent software!\\).\n\n‌\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/1010753774-locations.jpg)\n‌\n",
